WEBVTT

00:06:29.863 --> 00:06:33.930
even if it's stigmatized by the community.

00:06:33.930 --> 00:06:39.097
I work with incarcerated
and formerly incarcerated people.

00:06:39.130 --> 00:06:43.063
And that is one stigmatized group,
let me tell you.

00:06:43.097 --> 00:06:45.197
But one way to think about
it is, you know,

00:06:45.230 --> 00:06:47.130
"I have come through a rough time,

00:06:47.163 --> 00:06:53.697
and I have, in spite of
so many barriers, stuck with it,"

00:06:53.730 --> 00:06:59.030
and to get support from other people
who have made that transition.

00:06:59.497 --> 00:07:01.930
[How can you deal with shame that you feel